msgctxt "148"
msgid "I don't mean to brag, but I've never lost a fight. Ever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Really!? That's amazing, Nobu-kun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"The punk I was fighting yesterday crashed through a\r\n"
"window and got all bloodied up! Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Nobu-kun! Now, that's taking things a little too far!\r\n"
"He should've known not to pick a fight with you, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "(What the hell is this guy bragging about?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Hey, you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Yeah? Who're you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"I just overheard you talking. Is it true you never lost a\r\n"
"fight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Huh? Why should I have to tell <Italic>you</Italic>!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Just answer me. Is it true, or isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Well... Um..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Hey, who do you think you're talking to!? This is Nobu-kun,\r\n"
"you know⑬<Color:7>undefeated in fifty street battles<Color:Default>!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"<Color:7>Undefeated in fifty street battles<Color:Default>... Is that "
"really true?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Well, I guess you could say that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"In that case, I need your help! Do you know the Underground\r\n"
"Coliseum?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Underground Coliseum?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Yeah. I want you to join me for a tag match there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"What!? Hey, that's perfect! That oughta be easy for you,\r\n"
"Nobu-kun! Right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah... Easy! I'd be sure to win something like that!\r\n"
"Haha... hahaha..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Great! Will you enter with me, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Of course he will!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Wait a sec! I, uh, just remembered I've got an appointment\r\n"
"to get to! Sorry, maybe next time! Bye!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Wait up, Nobu-kun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Damn. I'll never find anybody."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "(Hmm? Haven't I seen that guy before...?)"
msgstr ""

